.TH SPRITE_DRAW_SCALED 3 "generalGameEngine" "Engine Manual" "Engine Manual"
.SH NAME
sprite_draw_scaled \- As sprite_draw, with the frame scaled by scale (2.0 doubles it; the camera's zoom is the usual argument)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include \(dqsprite.h\(dq
.BI "void sprite_draw_scaled(const Sprite *s, int frame, float x, float y, float scale, double angle, Flip flip);"
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
As sprite_draw, with the frame scaled by scale (2.0 doubles it; the camera's zoom is the usual argument). Scaling is about the top\-left corner: the drawn rectangle is x, y, frame_w*scale, frame_h*scale.
.SH MODULE
sprite (src/engine/sprite/sprite.h)
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR sprite_draw (3),
.BR Camera (3),
.BR gge\-api (7),
.BR gge (1)
